\**{c=red:Note:}** You must zone after completing {q:As Thick as Thieves|As Thick as Thieves|As Thick as Thieves} before starting this quest.
=4 Walkthrough
* Speak to {p:Nanaa Mihgo} in {z:Windurst Woods} (J-3) to receive the {@k} {k:Cat Burglar's note}.
* Go to {z:Lower Jeuno} (G-10) and speak to {n:Yatniel} on the top floor. He will ask for 4x {p:Quake Grenades|Quake Grenade}.
* Trade the {p:Quake Grenades|Quake Grenade} to him for a clue.
** **NOTE:** Although you can skip this part and get the {@k} {k:Bomb incense} and fight the Chandelier, you MUST turn in the {p:Quake Grenades|Quake Grenade} in order to clear the KI from Nanaa so she will allow you to complete the quest.
* Go to {z:Mhaura} (H-8) and speak to {n:Hagain} who is located in one of the upstairs rooms in the Sailor's Stay. He will give you the {@k} {k:Bomb incense}.
* Head to {z:Garlaige Citadel} via the main entrance. (The {p:Survival Guide} is the easiest way here.)
* You will now need to examine multiple **???** in a specific order. Go to each one and choose "Yes" to use the {@k} {k:Bomb incense}.
** **NOTE:** Switching to first person view and locking on to the points make it easier to target them. The **???** is in the ceiling.
** Walk to (I-9) (just south of Banishing Gate #1) for the first **???**.
** Head west, take the first left, and examine another **???** at (H-9).
** Go through the first Banishing Gate and hug the right wall to take a winding path down to (F-9). The **???** to the west of the intersection is the one you want.
** Go across the hall directly to the east for another **???** at (F/G-9).
** Go back the way you came towards Banishing Gate #1. Examine the **???** at (G-8/9).
** Head to the north of the large room (around the perimeter, not through the middle, because there are holes) for another **???** at (G-7).
** **READ THE NEXT SECTION BEFORE CLICKING THE NEXT (FINAL) ???.**
** Hug the wall and walk east and north to pop the NM at the (I-6) **???**.

* The last **???** will spawn a Bomb named {m:Chandelier}. If it aggros a player before being claimed (via sight or magic aggro), it will immediately use {s:Self-Destruct}.
** If it uses {s:Self-Destruct}, it will not drop the {i:Chandelier Coal|Chandelier Coal|1091} needed for this quest.
** If you fail to successfully claim {m:Chandelier} and it {s:Self-Destructs|Self-Destruct}, you will have to wait 10 minutes for the **???** to respawn.
*** You do not have to go back and check all the **???** again.
*** However, you __do__ have to go back and check all of the ??? again if you leave the zone. (So don't do that.)
* Using {p:Hide} or {p:Spectral Jig} immediately after the cutscene is the recommended way to avoid detection long enough to claim.
** And don't claim with a spell from THF/BLM or something, because it also aggros magic.

=4 Afterwards
* Go back to {z:Mhaura} and trade the {i:Chandelier Coal|Chandelier Coal|1091} to {n:Hagain}.
* Head to {z:Windurst Woods} and talk to {p:Nanaa Mihgo}.
** She will ask what letter was on your papers. The correct answer is "Blank," but any response will progress the quest.
* You'll need a {i:Pickaxe|Pickaxe|605} for this next step.
* Go to {z:Ordelle's Caves}. Enter the cave in {z:La Theine Plateau} at (F-7), or warp using a {p:Survival Guide}.
* **NOTE:** If you have the {p:Proto-Waypoint} in {z:La Theine Plateau}, you can warp to the valley and skip the below {z:Ordelle's Caves}. However, make sure you zone into {z:Ordelle's Caves} and then back out again before continuing or you can't trade the pickaxe.
** Take the path to the East at (H-3). This will take you to a different map eventually.
** On the new map, go to the path at (H-9). The map will switch to the first map you were on.
** Follow this path to the hole at (H-11/12).
*** Drop down this hole and head to the tunnel to the east (I-11).
*** Be careful not to fall off the cliff.
** Follow the stairs to the first intersection at (I-6) and take a left to head south. Take the tunnel to the right that heads west (H-9) and take it (you know you're on the right track if you see {m:Napalms|Napalm}).
** You'll zone back into {z:La Theine Plateau}.
* Head to the middle of the valley and find the **???** at the southwest corner of (H-10). Trade your {i:Pickaxe|Pickaxe|605} to the **???** for a cut scene and your reward.
** Other types of {i:Pickaxe|Pickaxe|605} will not work.

